            "patch": "*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: README.md\n@@\n-# Helpers\n-\n-Utilities.\n+# Helpers\n+\n+Utility functions for working with small pieces of data.\n+\n+## `numbers.total`\n+\n+`total(values)` 计算一个可迭代对象中所有数字的和：\n+\n+- 忽略值为 `None` 的元素；\n+- 保留 0 和负数，一并参与求和；\n+- 如果序列为空，或只包含 `None`，结果为 `0`。\n+\n+示例：\n+\n+```python\n+from numbers import total\n+\n+total([2, None, -1, 0])  # -> 1\n+total([None])            # -> 0\n+total([])                # -> 0\n+```\n+\n+## `labels.normalize`\n+\n+`normalize(value)` 用于清洗简单的文本标签：\n+\n+- 去除首尾空白字符（空格、换行等）；\n+- 将剩余内容全部转换为小写；\n+- 保留中间的空格，不会折叠或删除内部空格。\n+\n+示例：\n+\n+```python\n+from labels import normalize\n+\n+normalize(\" A B \")   # -> \"a b\"\n+normalize(\"  \")      # -> \"\"\n+normalize(\" Foo Bar \")  # -> \"foo bar\"\n+```\n*** End Patch",
